@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System
participant "Spotify" as Spotify

activate User

User -> System: asks to add the album to Spotify favourites
System -> Spotify: adds the album to the user's Spotify library
alt accepted
  Spotify --> System: confirms
  System --> User: informs success and disables the button
else rejected (400)
  Spotify --> System: returns an error
  System -> Spotify: retries with the alternative request format
  Spotify --> System: confirms or returns an error
  System --> User: informs success or the error
end
@enduml
